         location toggle and network source rows are meaningful. The GPS-only
         source row is hidden at runtime by Settings' LocationSettings base
         controller gating the GPS source on FEATURE_LOCATION_GPS (verified:
         packages/apps/Settings gates the GPS source on the feature, not on a
         config boolean). No Settings-specific config_gps boolean exists to
         override; this entry documents the contract. The real hiding is the
         runtime FEATURE_LOCATION_GPS absence. -->

